    "body": "Bumps [hs-cimple](https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple) from `cb00532` to `068888a`.\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/068888a1ddc977b73f7bdb3e6d265df47faacb96\"><code>068888a</code></a> feat: Add support for multi-file diagnostic spans.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/4445900720fa0a034f39dd1b682dfaf74b7359ea\"><code>4445900</code></a> fix: Better support for nullability annotations on non-pointers.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/723991901e5a1aa575db2d3ba903d8f10f517e77\"><code>7239919</code></a> feat: Add support for arrays in typedefs.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/da0e623869f5b609ebe26d85cc2dcb98f05a1ade\"><code>da0e623</code></a> fix: More succinct and precise gutter.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/b9376d1e257b355702e0987bd61ee5e81d27b985\"><code>b9376d1</code></a> feat: Add better rich diagnostics support.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/3fcfe73398e6285d8168d4e7018b78dc5494a7fb\"><code>3fcfe73</code></a> fix: Add more support for winapi weirdness.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/3aa5408e6b19b2a4dea6c64db6254803dd5a128e\"><code>3aa5408</code></a> fix: Add support for ASCII versions of winapi functions.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/d8ab7f82e4e7fbab4854831732c09b0221f8cf9a\"><code>d8ab7f8</code></a> refactor: Simplify array AST, remove CompoundExpr, add QuickCheck instances</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/91018ef66ac4ad1b77a75b7f576fd4b3d47db666\"><code>91018ef</code></a> feat: Much better error messages.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/commit/4b6ce0cd2c0434fa114e30f85944aa4391cb7bf3\"><code>4b6ce0c</code></a> fix: Correctly parse <code>*func()</code>.</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/TokTok/hs-cimple/compare/cb00532404536f741b88868e15fdf0c97c6263b1...068888a1ddc977b73f7bdb3e6d265df47faacb96\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n> **Note**\n> Automatic rebases have been disabled on this pull request as it has been open for over 30 days.\n",
